{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026IM8ahtbYpB1794796305.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>人民幣中間價連升三天，見逾兩周高位。</p><p></p><p>官方開出的人民幣中間價，報6.7141，較上個交易日上調11點子，是自10月30日以來的高位。現貨人民幣方面，在岸價和離岸價，早段都於6.67水平上落。</p><p></p><p>另外人民銀行開展4,600億元人民幣隔夜逆回購操作，扣除今日到期的逆回購，單日在市場淨投放960億元人民幣。為保持銀行體系流動性充裕，同日人行開展2,000億元人民幣買斷式逆回購操作，期限為6個月，操作量較今個月中到期量，減少1,000億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T03:51:52.384056+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":220,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T02:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-17T07:03:14.765206+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T03:45:11.723621+00:00","content_hash":"231e599c0e65eb148e17a6722fb713b258af38b264596be7aa85952a39eaa103","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-16T03:51:52.384056+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}